### Third-Party Model Attribution & Terms

QuietPatch supports Google's open-weight Gemma models (including Gemma 2, Gemma 3, and Gemma 4) under the Gemma Terms of Use.

- When utilizing Gemma locally via Ollama, model weights are hosted on the local machine under Google's open-weights terms.
- When utilizing Hosted Gemma via Google Gen AI SDK, inference requests are subject to Google Cloud / Google AI Studio API policies.
- Sentry SDK is licensed under the Apache 2.0 license.
- Lucide Icons are licensed under the ISC license.
